{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills and gather resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799300/extras/cc972ab5faa2e24ea843b74a7dd6247b.poster.avif?t=1749797135\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799300/extras/cc972ab5faa2e24ea843b74a7dd6247b.webm?t=1749797135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799300/extras/cc972ab5faa2e24ea843b74a7dd6247b.mp4?t=1749797135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect experience points and level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799300/extras/de7b816599e509688bd69ead31cb22b2.poster.avif?t=1749797135\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799300/extras/de7b816599e509688bd69ead31cb22b2.webm?t=1749797135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799300/extras/de7b816599e509688bd69ead31cb22b2.mp4?t=1749797135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The Vastness of the Galaxy</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Square Shooter,</i></strong>\u00a0you pilot your spaceship through the endless void of space\u2014always searching for valuable and rare resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But space is dangerous: asteroids and other dark threats are waiting to stop you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself well! Equip your ship with <strong>various</strong> weapons, gather <strong>resources</strong>, and unlock new <strong>features</strong> and <strong>upgrades</strong>. Only with the right gear will you have a chance to withstand the dangers out there and return stronger than ever before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799300/extras/426deef9ca5f7ed56525641b2550056b.webp?t=1749797135\" width=349 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Square Shooter</strong></i> is a classic arcade-style top-down shooter where players must fight through consecutive waves of enemies. By destroying asteroids, they collect various resources that contribute to meta-progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These resources allow the unlocking of new weapons and upgrades, enhancing combat power and increasing survivability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>About QuickBug Studios:</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799300/extras/4339b2ed2c88389568c99739ce5d7144.avif?t=1749797135\" width=394 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am a solo developer from the team <strong>QuickBug Studios</strong>. This is my first project, into which I have poured a great deal of time and passion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I sincerely appreciate any support! :D</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799300?t=1749797135","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799300/734dba751cb5a6697a6d40e907451bc0f76b40f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1