ios:</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799300/extras/4339b2ed2c88389568c99739ce5d7144.avif?t=1749797135\" width=394 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am a solo developer from the team <strong>QuickBug Studios</strong>. This is my first project, into which I have poured a great deal of time and passion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I sincerely appreciate any support! :D</p>","developers":["QuickBug Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799300/9140dea40a5095a626a5940f8e35e9e88f7f7593/header.jpg?t=1749797135","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Square Shooter","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.7 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1024 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512MB, OpenGL 3+</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600X 6-Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["QuickBug Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","ratin